/P 95 0 R
/E (Nestled in the heart of India, Bhopal, the capital of Madhya Pradesh, is a city where heritage, culture, and modernity blend seamlessly. Fondly known as the City of Lakes, Bhopal is adorned with picturesque water bodies, lush greenery, and an enduring spirit of hospitality. Strategically located at the center of the country, Bhopal serves as a gateway to some of India's most treasured heritage sites. Visitors are welcomed with warm hospitality, diverse cuisine, and an atmosphere that celebrates knowledge, innovation, and cultural diversity.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
